{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After Bad Dog, Good Time and visiting a little party, you met a few friends, which includes Banjo who you definitely didn't play patty-cake with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short visual novel to bridge a gap of time in between the two NSFW titles. It's primary goal is to provide a small backstory and feel of the character outside of the bedroom fun in the two games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a few gameplay elements that fall outside of the typical visual novel click-through and read. There is an early build of asteroid dodger which is an arcade style game, there is a mini-fishing game which gives a glimpse of what gameplay elements might come in Bad Dog, Good Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, I hope you enjoy reading and trying out a few new features planned and also knowing where the player (you) fits into all the titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the second ever title I've built, I've tried to learn and add in a new few things, its not much but I hope you enjoy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawsome Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018920/2e81f510c78f41a59a98c3e61f23a8362a63f51f.jpg"},{"name":"Caught The Fish!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018920/bd98987cf039ee4732d5f6657bd624e346796257.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018920?t=1769044910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018920?t=1769044910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/1f548528c5e388a2064832849d4ec73ce82e9e18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769044910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/1f548528c5e388a2064832849d4ec73ce82e9e18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769044910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Conversation about some past experiences of being abused and sexually-assaulted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After Bad Dog, Good Time and visiting a little party, you met a few friends, which includes Banjo who you definitely didn't play patty-cake with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short visual novel to bridge a gap of time in between the two NSFW titles. It's primary goal is to provide a small backstory and feel of the character outside of the bedroom fun in the two games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a few gameplay elements that fall outside of the typical visual novel click-through and read. There is an early build of asteroid dodger which is an arcade style game, there is a mini-fishing game which gives a glimpse of what gameplay elements might come in Bad Dog, Good Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, I hope you enjoy reading and trying out a few new features planned and also knowing where the player (you) fits into all the titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the second ever title I've built, I've tried to learn and add in a new few things, its not much but I hope you enjoy.</p>","developers":["Bad Dog Banjo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/5550394bfd26e75a6bf54030a09a3ab6f6e457de/header.jpg?t=1769044910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 7700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 7700k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018920/307531979/23d9565f26af4e99f3b94794124ee3dc18e9da0c/1758492707/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758493042","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018920/307531979/23d9565f26af4e99f3b94794124ee3dc18e9da0c/1758492707/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758493042","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018920/307531979/23d9565f26af4e99f3b94794124ee3dc18e9da0c/1758492707/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758493042","id":257203538,"name":"All My Heart, Banjo - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203538/21ccd75a0883330b5f54808b11477cf17733d536/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758493042"}],"name":"All My Heart, Banjo","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"All My Heart, Banjo - 